Triangle $XYZ$ is an enlargement of triangle $PQR$, with $X$ matching $P$, $Y$ matching $Q$ and $Z$ matching $R$. What is the value of $x$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) -- (1.62,0) node[midway,below] {$9\text{ cm}$};
\draw (1.62,0) -- (1.62,1.98) node[midway,right] {$11\text{ cm}$};
\draw (1.62,1.98) -- (0,0);
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$P$};
\node[below right] at (1.62,0) {$Q$};
\node[above] at (1.62,1.98) {$R$};
\draw (3.4,0) -- (3.4,2.43) node[midway,left] {$13.5\text{ cm}$};
\draw (3.4,0) -- (6.37,0) node[midway,below] {$x$};
\draw (6.37,0) -- (3.4,2.43);
\node[above] at (3.4,2.43) {$X$};
\node[below left] at (3.4,0) {$Y$};
\node[below right] at (6.37,0) {$Z$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

